  "Easy Badge Creation and Customization ": "Gemakkelijk badges maken en aanpassen ",
  "Creating and customizing product badges is a breeze with our intuitive interface. You can effortlessly design badges that align with your brand’s aesthetics and marketing goals. Whether you want to emphasize a \"New Arrival,\" \"Best Seller,\" \"Limited Edition,\" or any other key attribute, our module allows you to tailor the text and imagery to perfectly match your promotional strategy. This flexibility ensures that your product badges are not only visually appealing but also highly effective in communicating your messages.": "Het maken en aanpassen van productbadges is een fluitje van een cent met onze intuïtieve interface. ",
  "Seamless Integration with Your Store": "Naadloze integratie met uw winkel",
  "Once created, product badges are seamlessly integrated into your storefront. They appear prominently on product images, ensuring that they capture the attention of your customers as they browse through your offerings. This seamless integration means that there is no disruption to the shopping experience; instead, it enhances it by providing clear, concise information at a glance. This not only aids in the decision-making process but also adds a professional touch to your product listings.": "Eenmaal aangemaakt, worden productbadges naadloos geïntegreerd in uw winkelpui. ",
  "Robust Backend Management": "Robuust backendbeheer",
  "Managing your product badges from the backend is both simple and efficient. The Product Badge Management module offers a comprehensive dashboard where you can easily add, edit, or remove badges as needed. This centralized management system allows you to keep your badges up-to-date and relevant to your current promotions and inventory status. Additionally, the module supports bulk actions, enabling you to apply badges to multiple products simultaneously, saving you time and effort.": "Het beheren van uw productbadges vanuit de backend is zowel eenvoudig als efficiënt. ",
  "Boosting Sales and Customer Engagement": "Het stimuleren van verkoop en klantbetrokkenheid",
